---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service · The Cheapskate Club"
  description="Be cheap. Don’t be a cheat. Simple, honest terms for resourceful builders."
>
  <section class="prose" style="max-width: 760px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px;">
    <p class="eyebrow">HONEST RULES FOR ECONOMICAL BUILDERS</p>
    <h1>
      Terms of Service.<br />
      <em>Be cheap. Don’t be a cheat.</em>
    </h1>

    <h2>1. The Core Philosophy</h2>
    <p>
      The Cheapskate Club exists to celebrate intelligent frugality, multi-model cooperation, and resourceful software engineering. We believe expensive compute should be the exception, not the default.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Leaderboard Fair Play</h2>
    <p>
      Rankings and badges on <code>cheapos.lol</code> celebrate genuine developer usage. By participating, you agree not to submit falsified token reports, spoof cryptographic installation signatures, or manipulate leaderboard rankings. Accounts caught submitting synthetic or deceptive telemetry will be quietly retired by operator review.
    </p>

    <h2>3. The Workbench Standard</h2>
    <p>
      The Community Workbench (<code>/community</code>) is reserved for complete, working software built end-to-end with cheapoS and published with public source code on GitHub. Routine bugfixes, typo edits, and low-effort prompt spam will be rejected from the public showcase queue.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Open-Source Software Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      cheapoS and the leaderboard companion are provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied. You are solely responsible for reviewing code and automated diffs generated by AI models before executing them in production environments.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Frugal Domain Guarantee</h2>
    <p>
      In accordance with our founding principles, we pledge never to purchase an overpriced vanity domain name when a $1.80/year TLD serves the community with equal pride and speed.
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top: 36px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--surface-border);">
      <span style="font-size: var(--text-meta); color: var(--text-secondary);">
        Last updated: September 2026 · The Cheapskate Club
      </span>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
